<title>USA: Penederm gets UK approval for acne gel.</title>
<headline>Penederm gets UK approval for acne gel.</headline>
<dateline>FOSTER CITY, Calif 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Penederm Inc said it received approval in Britain to market its retinoic acid cream and gel formulations for the treatment of acne.</p>
<p>The products were given marketing approval and contingent approval, respectively, by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration in January and will be marketed in the U.S. under the trademark AVITA.</p>
<p>Britain will be Penederm's sponsor country to gain approval in other European nations through the European Mutual Recognition Process.</p>
</text>
